@startuml sm-placement-reconciliation
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #1D4ED8
  FontColor #0F172A
}
title State Machine — PlacementReconciliation (MF-04 UC-41, HEADHUNT_COD)
left to right direction
[*] --> PENDING : Client reports STARTED / NOT_STARTED
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : Internal HR confirms (fee -> DUE)
PENDING --> FLAGGED : Internal HR flags mismatch (note)
FLAGGED --> CONFIRMED : Platform Admin resolves / reopens
CONFIRMED --> [*]
@enduml
